 civilian adults.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sex-specific weights by age group were applied for persons aged 18–44, 45–64, and ≥65 years.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses were conducted using SAS-callable SUDAAN (version 9.4; RTI International) and account for complex survey design.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}